{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/c3jjb8","slideIndex":0,"text":"Small business owners may have a good product and a phone, but choosing and adapting a trend requires marketing judgment. The survey establishes the customer-acquisition problem; it does not prove demand for TrendForge. Source: https://www.constantcontact.com/news/2025-03-04-new-wave-of-smbs-is-social-first-technology-driven-and-highly-adaptable . Published March 4, 2025. Survey of 1,600 businesses operating for five years or less across the US, UK, Australia and Canada. 52% identified customer acquisition as their top marketing challenge."}
