{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/tmzy07","slideIndex":1,"text":"This is a use case, not a customer success story. A jewelry seller has a new necklace and wants store visits. They need a relevant format and practical filming instructions. The same workflow could apply to other small businesses marketing a physical product. The image was generated for illustration using OpenAI image generation and is not evidence of a customer or a real event."}
