{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/s1qfx1","slideIndex":2,"text":"Demo flow: select a trend, inspect its analysis, enter a product brief, generate a shot-by-shot filming guide, and upload a draft for specific feedback. Keep the demo focused on the human filming workflow. AI writes the plan, but generating a video is not required. Product capabilities are supported by the project implementation in lib/analysis.ts and lib/viral.ts; do not imply that suggestions guarantee sales or virality. During a live demo, show one useful instruction and one concrete draft improvement."}
