{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/4xi8vf","slideIndex":3,"text":"The business goal is to help small business owners generate more value from the time they spend creating content. We have not validated a revenue uplift. In a pilot, compare multiple comparable posts with and without TrendForge, recording time spent, tracked store visits and attributed orders. Use tracked links or codes; attributed sales alone do not establish causal lift. Longer term, account for contribution margin and content/tool costs. Do not use the prototype expected-views estimate or score-after-fixes as evidence of financial performance. Close by returning to the use case: an owner should leave knowing what to film and how to improve it."}